# ============================================================
# .gitignore — VIABILITY_FRAMEWORK / Book I
# Policy: ONLY *.tex files are tracked. Everything else ignored.
# ============================================================

# 1) Ignore everything by default (whitelist strategy)
*

# 2) Un-ignore the .gitignore itself (so the rule stays in repo)
!.gitignore

# 3) Un-ignore all directories so git can descend into them
#    (without this, git won't look inside ignored dirs)
!*/

# 4) Allow only .tex files
!*.tex